			"Message": "style(Output): Remove excess blank lines from configuration modules\n\nNormalize whitespace across Configuration/ and Source/ modules by removing inter-statement blank lines. Imports, declarations, function bodies, array literals, plugin pipelines, and export sections now use compact spacing with no empty lines between adjacent statements or object properties.\n\nNo behavioral changes; only formatting/whitespace normalization.",
